{
    "word": "incivility",
    "lang_code": "en",
    "source_file_to_entries": {
        "raw-wiktextract-data.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "c40edc78-9e5a-3b04-8ad7-1855f680e022",
                "word": "incivility",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "a6cb7e8d-a035-42ec-a5f4-4a9947fe3c95",
                        "entry_id": "c40edc78-9e5a-3b04-8ad7-1855f680e022",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "incivilities"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "b4dc23c0-7f2f-3e97-986c-70a06cfb5df5",
                        "entry_id": "c40edc78-9e5a-3b04-8ad7-1855f680e022",
                        "glosses": [
                            "The state of being uncivil; lack of courtesy; rudeness in manner."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "99dd9e0e-1181-40a1-bc05-f9fd394164dd",
                                "sense_id": "b4dc23c0-7f2f-3e97-986c-70a06cfb5df5",
                                "text": "Courtezan. How say you now? is not your husband mad? / Adriana. His incivility confirms no less."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "daa8d53a-d119-4949-87a8-74e88cc0019e",
                                "sense_id": "b4dc23c0-7f2f-3e97-986c-70a06cfb5df5",
                                "text": "1668, David Lloyd, Memoires of the Lives, Actions, Sufferings, and Deaths of those Noble, Reverend, and Excellent Personages that suffered by Death, Sequestration, Decimation, and otherwise for the Protestant Religion, London: Samuel Speed, “The Life and Death of Robert Berkley,” p. 96,\nBeat on proud Billows, Boreas blow,\nSwell curled Waves, high as Jove’s roof,\nYour incivility doth show,\nThat Innocence is tempest proof."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ecb9fddf-8851-4a5f-8fab-43cd8de5743a",
                                "sense_id": "b4dc23c0-7f2f-3e97-986c-70a06cfb5df5",
                                "text": "Little did Mr. Willoughby imagine, I suppose, when his looks censured me for incivility in breaking up the party, that I was called away to the relief of one whom he had made poor and miserable […]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d97857aa-c056-47b6-acbc-842f6e7107c1",
                                "sense_id": "b4dc23c0-7f2f-3e97-986c-70a06cfb5df5",
                                "text": "[S]he could not bear incivility to her guests, to young men in particular, […]"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "ef2aead8-bbce-3964-9c2d-972d008efe71",
                        "entry_id": "c40edc78-9e5a-3b04-8ad7-1855f680e022",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Any act of rudeness or ill-breeding."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "countable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "787a76e0-da6b-4300-a217-5fb68ab1ef80",
                                "sense_id": "ef2aead8-bbce-3964-9c2d-972d008efe71",
                                "text": "Latona, in her flight from Juno, is churlishly intreated by the Lycian pesants, and denied the publique benefit of water: for which incivility these bawling Clownes are changed into croaking froggs, and confined unto that Lake for ever."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "b3362ea2-ff3d-4631-b108-706a9258ab20",
                                "sense_id": "ef2aead8-bbce-3964-9c2d-972d008efe71",
                                "text": "In truth, vve thought it (coming immediately from an infected place) an hazardous incivilitie, to put our ſelves upon them; for if any ſiniſter accident had fallen out about the ſame time (for Coincidents are not alvvaies Cauſes) vve ſhould have rued it for ever."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "7d4669ae-87e7-4384-966c-be0214441b17",
                                "sense_id": "ef2aead8-bbce-3964-9c2d-972d008efe71",
                                "text": "Mr. Lovelace, for three days together, sent twice each day to inquire after my brother’s health; and, altho’ he received rude, and even shocking returns, he thought fit, on the fourth day, to make in person the fame inquiries; and received still greater incivilities from my two uncles, who happen’d to be both there."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d8e3f5b0-c0b1-49cf-9b3b-74a71cfc9837",
                                "sense_id": "ef2aead8-bbce-3964-9c2d-972d008efe71",
                                "text": "When my poor Sidebottom was alive, if there had been any unpleasantness between us during the day … I have shaken him at night to wake him up, that he might receive my pardon for an incivility said or done."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "899f8844-0743-3707-9bd4-36843cb76628",
                        "entry_id": "c40edc78-9e5a-3b04-8ad7-1855f680e022",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Lack of civilization; a state of rudeness or barbarism."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "f90327c2-bd36-4766-a32c-baa5ef016438",
                                "sense_id": "899f8844-0743-3707-9bd4-36843cb76628",
                                "text": "BEAT on, proud billows; Boreas blow; / Swell, curled waves, high as Jove's roof; / Your incivility doth ſhow, / That innocence is tempeſt proof; / Though ſurly Nereus frown, my thoughts are calm; / Then ſtrike, Affliction, for thy wounds are balm. [Attributed to Roger L'Estrange (1616–1704).]"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "77a6dc5a-79df-4200-ba8b-602e3cc982fd",
                        "source_entry_id": "c40edc78-9e5a-3b04-8ad7-1855f680e022",
                        "source_sense_description": "state of being uncivil; lack of courtesy; rudeness in manner",
                        "target_lang_word": "unhöfliches Benehmen",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": []
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "60cdbc6b-b369-4253-8a3e-3d41809eaf62",
                        "source_entry_id": "c40edc78-9e5a-3b04-8ad7-1855f680e022",
                        "source_sense_description": "state of being uncivil; lack of courtesy; rudeness in manner",
                        "target_lang_word": "Unhöflichkeit",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Unhöflichkeit",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "54246925-5088-38f9-9903-3b41dfc2114b",
                                        "entry_id": "866df846-8b1e-3ab0-9544-66d10934914d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "ungesittetes, beleidigendes oder unangebrachtes Verhalten"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "no-plural"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "221c2586-d6ed-41cc-9caf-cae17e2f1e08",
                                                "sense_id": "54246925-5088-38f9-9903-3b41dfc2114b",
                                                "text": "Seine Unhöflichkeit war ausschlaggebend für das Scheitern der Verträge."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7112e57d-b197-4aa0-8b76-2bee12503f16",
                                                "sense_id": "54246925-5088-38f9-9903-3b41dfc2114b",
                                                "text": "„Wie bereits erwähnt, grenzt sich Unhöflichkeit von Aggression durch die fehlende oder zumindest nicht deutlich erkennbare Intention ab, dem Opfer Schaden zufügen zu wollen.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "440b3959-1f6a-45ab-8fb1-f053f4055424",
                                                "sense_id": "54246925-5088-38f9-9903-3b41dfc2114b",
                                                "text": "„So verstrich eine Weile, ohne daß er sich der Unhöflichkeit bewußt wurde, den Maler in dem Vorraum warten zu lassen, wo man ihm einen Hocker angewiesen hatte.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7fd4483c-0ccd-3176-8bc1-912eb4fe7cea",
                                        "entry_id": "866df846-8b1e-3ab0-9544-66d10934914d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "würdelose Handlung oder Äußerung"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bff76d9b-de4b-4769-aa70-c308c51c1910",
                                                "sense_id": "7fd4483c-0ccd-3176-8bc1-912eb4fe7cea",
                                                "text": "„Unhöflichkeiten werden abgebogen, indem man nicht darauf reagiert.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7391cec5-d181-48b5-88ec-798be78b7b90",
                                                "sense_id": "7fd4483c-0ccd-3176-8bc1-912eb4fe7cea",
                                                "text": "„Bevor ich mich zu weiteren Unhöflichkeiten hinreißen lassen konnte, verabschiedeten Kathrin und ich uns von Oma und zogen los.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"2\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "67c516ab-cbd5-44d3-be08-e1742d25f8f8",
                        "source_entry_id": "c40edc78-9e5a-3b04-8ad7-1855f680e022",
                        "source_sense_description": "state of being uncivil; lack of courtesy; rudeness in manner",
                        "target_lang_word": "Grobheit",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Grobheit",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b9039bee-2472-311c-b3c2-a86df776c277",
                                        "entry_id": "10a1e9dd-9f72-37c4-b2b5-04993288f9d2",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "grobe, ruppige, wenig feinfühlige Art"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "no-plural"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e0acdf27-673b-46f6-a56f-e26847bee8cf",
                                                "sense_id": "b9039bee-2472-311c-b3c2-a86df776c277",
                                                "text": "Seine Grobheit erregte immer wieder Abscheu."
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e52ce0ac-dc7f-3bca-aaac-67460c5d19af",
                                        "entry_id": "10a1e9dd-9f72-37c4-b2b5-04993288f9d2",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Verhalten, sich grob zu äußern oder grob zu handeln"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6388195d-774f-4716-a9a3-8e5046cecb66",
                                                "sense_id": "e52ce0ac-dc7f-3bca-aaac-67460c5d19af",
                                                "text": "„Auf dem Heimweg brabbelt er allerlei sexuelle Grobheiten vor sich hin.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bebb6783-735c-4b1f-8b4b-ecf1b9c7c117",
                                                "sense_id": "e52ce0ac-dc7f-3bca-aaac-67460c5d19af",
                                                "text": "„Mochten sich die einen an Luthers Schriften begeistern, andere sich über sie empören, wieder andere sich kopfschüttelnd über seine Grobheiten amüsieren – gleichgültig ließen sie niemanden.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"2\""
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e5ba6207-6ee8-3f54-a9d6-084ecc8c99d5",
                                        "entry_id": "10a1e9dd-9f72-37c4-b2b5-04993288f9d2",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Eigenschaft eines groben, rauen Materials; Eigenschaft, sich grob/rau anzufühlen"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "751abf1b-028a-4f66-9a64-4e1a31faa2af",
                                                "sense_id": "e5ba6207-6ee8-3f54-a9d6-084ecc8c99d5",
                                                "text": "Ein Tuch von solcher Grobheit schien uns in diesem Fall nicht passend zu sein."
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"3\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
